From 198adea7a787f4e0aedf8499542db6007dbfbf26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 03:15:52 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] issuance: replace log2-difficulty formula with
 height-based boot subsidy

R_n^boot = R_0 >> (nHeight / BOOT_HALF_LIFE)

Initial reward 10M XPI/block, halving every 52,560 blocks (~73 days).
Sharply rewards miners who pay attention at launch; decays to 260 XPI floor.
GetBlockSubsidy signature changes from (nBits, params) to (nHeight, params).
